  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0: First public release. Diagnoses why a change deployed with a managed solution does not show in the target environment, for forms, views, web resources and processes (classic workflows, business rules, actions, cloud flows). Dev vs Target compare, solution layers, publish state, solution membership, flow state and connection references; confirmed fixes that show the user they run as; HTML/CSV/text reports.",
